The following uses or conditions shall be and are hereby prohibited within wellhead protection zones, whether or not such use or condition may otherwise be ordinarily included as apart of a use permitted under section 14-63:
(1) Surface use or storage of hazardous material, expressly including commercial use of agricultural pesticides;
